@startuml
' 11 顺序图：办理还书（UC-102） —— 指导书步骤 4
' 渲染：java -jar plantuml.jar specs/11-sequence-return-book.puml

autonumber
skinparam maxMessageSize 120

actor    "图书管理员"            as Librarian
participant "ReturnController"    as Ctrl      <<presentation>>
participant "RequireRoleAspect"   as Aspect    <<presentation>>
participant "CirculationApplicationService" as AppSvc <<application>>
participant "CirculationService"  as Domain    <<domain>>
participant "LibraryItemRepository" as ItemRepo <<domain.repository>>
participant "LoanRepository"      as LoanRepo  <<domain.repository>>
participant "FineCalculator"      as Calc      <<domain service>>
participant "FineRuleRepository"  as RuleRepo  <<domain.repository>>

== 1. 鉴权 ==

Librarian -> Ctrl : POST /api/loans/return\n{barcode}\nX-Operator-Role=LIBRARIAN
Ctrl -> Aspect : 校验操作人角色
Aspect -->> Ctrl : 通过

note right of Ctrl
  指导书原文：还书时学生只需
  把图书交给管理员，管理员
  输入图书信息 —— 因此还书
  不需要借阅证
end note

== 2. 进入应用服务（事务边界） ==

Ctrl -> AppSvc : returnItem(request, operator)
activate AppSvc
AppSvc -> Domain : returnItem(barcode, librarianId, today)
activate Domain

== 3. 验证本馆藏书（BR-008） ==

Domain -> ItemRepo : findByBarcode(barcode)
activate ItemRepo
ItemRepo -->> Domain : LibraryItem
deactivate ItemRepo

alt 条码不属于本馆
    Domain -->> AppSvc : throw ItemNotOwnedException
    AppSvc -->> Ctrl : 404 非本馆藏书
    Ctrl -->> Librarian : 提示"非本馆藏书，无法办理归还"
else 副本状态为"在馆"（无在借记录）
    Domain -->> AppSvc : throw LoanNotFoundException
    AppSvc -->> Ctrl : 409 该副本未借出
    Ctrl -->> Librarian : 提示"该副本当前未借出"
else 是本馆藏书且在借
    == 4. 定位在借记录 ==
    Domain -> LoanRepo : findActiveByItemId(itemId)
    activate LoanRepo
    LoanRepo -->> Domain : Loan{borrowDate, dueDate, status}
    deactivate LoanRepo

    == 5. 判定是否超期（UC-903：扩展点） ==
    Domain -> Domain : overdue = loan.isOverdue(today)

    alt 未超期
        Domain -> Domain : 跳过罚款计算
    else 已超期
        Domain -> Calc : calculateAndCreate(loan, today)
        activate Calc
        Calc -> RuleRepo : findByItemType(item.itemType)
        activate RuleRepo
        RuleRepo -->> Calc : FineRule{graceDays, dailyRate, maxAmount}
        deactivate RuleRepo
        Calc -> Calc : overdueDays = today - dueDate - graceDays
        Calc -> Calc : amount = min(overdueDays x dailyRate, maxAmount)   '' BR-009
        Calc -->> Domain : FineRecord{amount, status=UNPAID}
        deactivate Calc
    end

    == 6. 结清借阅信息并更新副本与账户 ==
    Domain -> Domain : loan.markReturned(today)
    Domain -> Domain : item.markReturned()
    Domain -> LoanRepo : save(loan)
    activate LoanRepo
    LoanRepo -->> Domain : Loan（已持久化）
    deactivate LoanRepo
    Domain -> ItemRepo : save(item)
    activate ItemRepo
    ItemRepo -->> Domain : LibraryItem（状态 IN_LIBRARY）
    deactivate ItemRepo

    == 7. 检查该读者是否还有超期未还图书 ==
    Domain -> LoanRepo : findActiveByReaderId(readerId)
    activate LoanRepo
    LoanRepo -->> Domain : List<Loan>
    deactivate LoanRepo
    Domain -->> AppSvc : Loan + FineRecord + 其余超期清单
end

deactivate Domain

== 8. 装配响应 ==

AppSvc -> AppSvc : 组装 ReturnResponse
AppSvc -->> Ctrl : ReturnResponse{loanId, returned=true, fineAmount}
deactivate AppSvc
Ctrl -->> Librarian : 200 还书成功；若超期显示罚款金额与其余超期书目

@enduml
